@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Documents List

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "KnowledgeDocumentView" as DocView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

Admin -> DocView : 1 Open documents list page
activate DocView
DocView -> DocView : 2 Display documents list

DocView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request documents data
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch documents info
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve documents records
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return documents data
ClerkAuth -> DocView : 7 Return documents info
DocView -> Admin : 8 Display documents list

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate DocView

@enduml
